FIXING INCONSISTENT LABELS
Fixing inconsistent labels is a crucial part of data cleaning. Inconsistent labels can silently sabotage your machine learning model by creating duplicate classes, misleading statistics, or data leakage.

| Inconsistent                  | Intended Label |
| ----------------------------- | -------------- |
| `"Yes"`, `"yes"`, `"YES"`     | `"Yes"`        |
| `"no"`, `"No "`, `" NO"`      | `"No"`         |
| `"N/A"`, `"na"`, `""`, `None` | Missing        |

